Files: usr/share/xournal-qt/hwr-models/*
Copyright: xournal-qt contributors (the trained weights); the datasets' authors, see each model's LICENCE.md
Comment: The handwriting models that xournal-qt reads handwriting with, one folder each. They are not covered by the
 GNU General Public License of the program: each folder's LICENCE.md says under which terms its model may be used.
 The models shipped now were trained on datasets that may be used for non-commercial purposes only (the IAM
 Handwriting Database: non-commercial research use; the CVL Database: CC BY-NC 4.0), so they are for non-commercial
 use only. The program works without them: switching the handwriting search off, or removing the folder, leaves
 everything else working.
License: non-commercial
 For non-commercial use only. The terms are those of /usr/share/xournal-qt/hwr-models/<name>/LICENCE.md, which
 lists the datasets each model was trained on and their licences.

